        "created_at": "2023-02-22T07:53:18Z",
        "updated_at": "2023-02-22T07:53:18Z",
        "body": "Hi Shivvrat,\r\n\r\nWe use the multi-view nature of our dataset and utilize [MegATrack](https://research.facebook.com/publications/megatrack-monochrome-egocentric-articulated-hand-tracking-for-virtual-reality/) to estimate the 3D hand poses of both hands. You can refer to Sec. 3.3 of our [paper](https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/papers/Sener_Assembly101_A_Large-Scale_Multi-View_Video_Dataset_for_Understanding_Procedural_Activities_CVPR_2022_paper.pdf) for more details.",
        "author_association": "OWNER",
        "pin": null,
