      "body": " an example:   assembly_nusar-2021_action_both_9011-b06b_9011_user_id_2021-02-01_154253.txt\r\n```\r\nstart_frame      end_frame       action\r\n000002833\t000003156\tattach interior\t\r\n000003156\t000004607\tattach wheel\t\r\n000004607\t000005151\tattach turntable top\t\r\n000005151\t000005613\tattach hook\t\r\n000005613\t000006110\tattach crane arm\t\r\n000006110\t000006394\tattach cabin\t\r\n000006394\t000006959\tdemonstrate functionality\t\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe start frame of the first action segment is not 0 but 2833. Does this mean that the frames 0-2832 is background?\r\nSimilarly, will there be a background after the end frame of the last action segment?",
