        "created_at": "2022-10-31T10:13:38Z",
        "updated_at": "2022-10-31T10:13:38Z",
        "body": "Each sequence first consists of a disassembly segment and then an assembly segment.\r\n\r\nIf you check the name of the annotation files, you will see that some of them starts with `disassembly...` and some of them starts with `assembly...` i.e. each video has been annotated separately (once for disassembly and once for assembly).\r\n\r\nThe annotations for `assembly...` generally starts from the middle of the sequence (after disassembly is done), hence it starts with non-zero frame number like the case you mentioned.",
        "author_association": "OWNER",
        "pin": null,
        "reactions": {
